title Energy Analytics Business Process

VPPaaS->Camunda: Trigger Analytics Computation
Camunda->Kong: Forward Request
Kong->Analytics Service: Forward Request
activate Analytics Service

Analytics Service->Telemetry Service: Get all telemetry data
activate Telemetry Service
Telemetry Service->Database: Query all telemetry readings
Database-->Telemetry Service: Telemetry records
Telemetry Service-->Analytics Service: Response (telemetry data)
deactivate Telemetry Service

note right of Analytics Service: Aggregate:\n- Energy Discharged by Zone\n- Generated Energy by Prosumer\n- Consumed Energy by Prosumer\n- Average SoC

Analytics Service->Database: INSERT INTO EnergyAnalytics\n(analyticsType, dimensionKey, value, timestamp)
Database-->Analytics Service: OK

Analytics Service->Kafka: Publish — energy-discharged-by-zone
Analytics Service->Kafka: Publish — generated-energy-by-prosumer
Analytics Service->Kafka: Publish — consumed-energy-by-prosumer
Analytics Service->Kafka: Publish — average-soc

Analytics Service-->Kong: Response
deactivate Analytics Service
Kong-->Camunda: Forward Response
Camunda-->VPPaaS: Forward Response
